  </picture>
		<h2>The Council Chronicle from Councilman Tom Segrave – June 18, 2026</h2>
		<p class="published-on small-text">Published on June 18, 2026</p>
		<p>Council President Segrave provides updates on City Council and City activities in this Council Chronicle.</p>
	</a>
</div><div class="col-xs-12 col-m-6 col-lg-4">
	<a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/News-articles/Cheyenne-Bike-Week-2026-kicks-off-this-weekend" class="profile-list item-1 homepage-show" >		
		
       <picture>
  <source media="(min-width: 992px)" srcset="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/bike-week-2026.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=380&h=242">
  <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/bike-week-2026.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=315">
  <source srcset="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/bike-week-2026.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=480&h=305">
  <img class="large-thumbnail-image" src="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/bike-week-2026.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=315" alt=""/>
  </picture>
		<h2>Cheyenne Bike Week 2026 kicks off this weekend</h2>
		<p class="published-on small-text">Published on June 17, 2026</p>
		<p>Bike to Work Day events, a poker run, and family-friendly Slow Roll rides are all on the calendar as Cheyenne Bike Week begins this weekend.<br/><br/>Events are free and open to anyone who wants to grab a bike and explore Cheyenne on two wheels!</p>
	</a>
</div><div class="col-xs-12 col-m-6 col-lg-4">
	<a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/News-articles/Ward-III-reps-to-hold-June-2026-Council-and-Coffee-open-house" class="profile-list item-2 homepage-show" >		
		
       <picture>
  <source media="(min-width: 992px)" srcset="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/council-coffee-new.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=380&h=242">
  <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/council-coffee-new.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=315">
  <source srcset="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/council-coffee-new.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=480&h=305">
  <img class="large-thumbnail-image" src="/files/assets/public/v/1/stock/events/council-coffee-new.jpg?dimension=homepagelisting&w=496&h=315" alt=""/>
  </picture>
		<h2>Ward III reps to hold June 2026 Council and Coffee open house</h2>
		<p class="published-on small-text">Published on June 17, 2026</p>
		<p>Cheyenne’s City Council Ward III representatives will hold a Council and Coffee open house on Saturday, June 20, from 9-11 a.m. at Dazbog Coffee (3911 E. Pershing Blvd., Suite A).<br/><br/>Discussion will include items related to Ward III and other city projects, with the opportunity for residents to voice concerns and get to know their representatives.</p>
	</a>
</div></div>
</div>
